    "shop_smart":  [
                       "The lo mein noodles are the biggest cost in this batch. Check the Asian aisle price per ounce against spaghetti; in a pinch, spaghetti swaps in and cuts this recipe\u0027s cost nearly in half.",
                       "Green cabbage is one of the cheapest vegetables per pound in the entire produce section, and a whole head shreds down into a mountain of stir-fry filler.",
